{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49859","headline":"舞春风 · 冯延巳","name":"舞春风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严妆才罢怨春风，粉墙画壁宋家东。\n蕙兰有恨枝尤绿，桃李无言花自红。\n燕燕巢儿罗幕卷，莺莺啼处凤楼空。\n少年薄幸知何处，每夜归来春梦中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}